  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Start with a frequency map.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 1540,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 46,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Put zero with frequency one, then set prefix to zero and answer to zero.",
      "start_ms": 2140,
      "end_ms": 7680,
      "start_frame": 64,
      "end_frame": 230,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "Now move through the array one value at a time.",
      "start_ms": 8180,
      "end_ms": 11540,
      "start_frame": 245,
      "end_frame": 346,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the current value to the prefix, then calculate needed equals prefix minus K.",
      "start_ms": 12100,
      "end_ms": 18700,
      "start_frame": 363,
      "end_frame": 561,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "Now query the frequency map.",
      "start_ms": 19300,
      "end_ms": 21040,
      "start_frame": 579,
      "end_frame": 631,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "How many earlier prefixes equal needed?",
      "start_ms": 21600,
      "end_ms": 23940,
      "start_frame": 648,
      "end_frame": 718,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Add that frequency to the answer.",
      "start_ms": 24580,
      "end_ms": 26440,
      "start_frame": 737,
      "end_frame": 793,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Only after the lookup, increase the frequency of the current prefix, then continue to the next value.",
      "start_ms": 26960,
      "end_ms": 33620,
      "start_frame": 809,
      "end_frame": 1009,
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "Finally, return the answer.",
      "start_ms": 34140,
      "end_ms": 36660,
      "start_frame": 1024,
      "end_frame": 1100,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Notice the order again.",
      "start_ms": 37300,
      "end_ms": 38540,
      "start_frame": 1119,
      "end_frame": 1156,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Update prefix, compute needed, query earlier prefixes, add matches, then store current prefix.",
      "start_ms": 39120,
      "end_ms": 46800,
      "start_frame": 1174,
      "end_frame": 1404,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "The lookup comes before the insert.",
      "start_ms": 47700,
      "end_ms": 49560,
      "start_frame": 1431,
      "end_frame": 1487,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "That is part of correctness.",
      "start_ms": 50100,
      "end_ms": 51880,
      "start_frame": 1503,
      "end_frame": 1556,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Now the complexity.",
      "start_ms": 52620,
      "end_ms": 53660,
      "start_frame": 1579,
      "end_frame": 1610,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "We scan the array once.",
      "start_ms": 54160,
      "end_ms": 55800,
      "start_frame": 1625,
      "end_frame": 1674,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "For each element, we do a constant amount of arithmetic and expected constant time hash map operations.",
      "start_ms": 55800,
      "end_ms": 63320,
      "start_frame": 1674,
      "end_frame": 1900,
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "So the expected time complexity is O of N for auxiliary space.",
      "start_ms": 64060,
      "end_ms": 69020,
      "start_frame": 1922,
      "end_frame": 2071,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "In the worst case, many prefix sums can be different.",
      "start_ms": 69860,
      "end_ms": 73420,
      "start_frame": 2096,
      "end_frame": 2203,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "So the map can store O of N prefix values.",
      "start_ms": 73840,
      "end_ms": 77180,
      "start_frame": 2215,
      "end_frame": 2315,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Therefore auxiliary space is O of N.",
      "start_ms": 77600,
      "end_ms": 80320,
      "start_frame": 2328,
      "end_frame": 2410,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "So method two changes the repeated O of N squared range search into one expected O of N pass.",
      "start_ms": 80780,
      "end_ms": 88400,
      "start_frame": 2423,
      "end_frame": 2652,
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "The important relation is current prefix minus previous prefix equals K cause.",
      "start_ms": 89300,
      "end_ms": 95320,
      "start_frame": 2679,
      "end_frame": 2860,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "That lets us replace many possible starting position checks with one required prefix lookup.",
      "start_ms": 96220,
      "end_ms": 103140,
      "start_frame": 2887,
      "end_frame": 3094,
      "word_count": 14
    }
  ],
